{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-17T09:26:20.656Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"ddb2e572b3dc24915ab9fe76","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.326","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-17T09:26:20.656Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-17T09:26:20.656Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 1 on PR 1746 widened this fix. The rescan now triggers for every reference or placeholder opener (dollar-brace, dollar-paren, dollar-name, angle), not only command and braced references. A rejected inner value that holds a reference is entered in turn, so a password assignment two references deep, or inside a placeholder or a required-variable message, is reached. Linearity: the rescan runs only for a rule whose sole predicate is its literal minimum (password_assignment). Such a rejected value spells fewer literal characters than any key of the rule with its separator, so every key inside it sits in a reference body, and bodies nest a bounded number of levels. credential_key_assignment, which also rejects on entropy and its literal grammar, uses its baseline reading instead. Pinned linear-time rows cover nested siblings and placeholder chains."}]}],"before_hash":"051ebe9df647de2f0edbadb532b7155212b8342c765a4acf9fd6ddc6644ae411","after_hash":"dcec37fd1234fc2a891945ff32975cea075921418739f8f43169eb3fea98b3d3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d308eebfaf38439fe9245494723b2e0d46ca05f7ebeaef8a4341a5463cf58761"}
